Plan 2.

Run for the stairs.  It's only two squares away.  I'll try to force the
two of them (at least '&') up to the next level, so I can engrave
Elbereth everywhere and play upstairs-downstairs.

I try waiting for two consecutive turns so I can get a "free move", but
